          "code": "prox_goldstein_stationarity",
          "description_paragraphs": [
            "$\\ell(I,x)=\\min_{g\\in\\partial_\\rho f(x)}\\gamma^{-1}\\|x-\\operatorname{prox}_{\\gamma\\psi}(x-\\gamma g)\\|_2$, where $\\gamma>0$ is a fixed known step size. The target tolerance is $\\varepsilon$.",
            "$\\partial_\\rho f(x)=\\operatorname{conv}\\bigcup_{\\|y-x\\|_2\\le\\rho}\\partial f(y)$, where $\\partial f$ is the Clarke subdifferential of the function on the ambient space."
